const t=[{name:"Proof by contrapositive",options:{blocks:[{content:"We will assume that for positive real numbers \\\\(x \\\\)  and \\\\(y\\\\) , it is not the case that \\\\(x \\\\gt 100 \\\\) or \\\\(y \\\\lt 10\\\\) , and we shall prove that \\\\(\\frac{x}{y} \\\\le 10\\\\).",dependsOn:[],hint:"The proof must begin with a statement of what will be assumed and what will be proven."},{content:"Since it is not true that \\\\(x \\\\gt 100 \\\\)  or \\\\(y \\\\lt 10 \\\\) , then by de Morgan's law, the statement \\\\(x \\\\gt 100 \\\\)  and the statement \\\\(y \\\\lt 10 \\\\)  are both false. Therefore \\\\(100 \\\\ge x \\\\)  and \\\\(y \\\\ge 10 \\\\).",dependsOn:[0],hint:"The proof must justify the assumptions that it is not true that \\\\(x \\\\gt 100 \\\\)  or \\\\(y \\\\lt 10 \\\\). This assumption is not given explicitly in the statement of the theorem."},{content:"Since \\\\(y \\\\)  is positive and \\\\(100 \\\\ge x \\\\) , we can divide both sides of the inequality by \\\\(y \\\\)  to establish that \\\\(\\\\frac{100}{y} \\\\ge \\\\frac{x}{y} \\\\).",dependsOn:[1],hint:"The proof needs to establish that \\\\(100 \\\\ge x \\\\)  before the inequality can be used."},{content:"Since \\\\(y \\\\)  is positive and \\\\(y \\\\ge 10 \\\\) , we can multiply both sides of the inequality by \\\\(10 \\\\)  and divide by \\\\(y \\\\)  to establish that \\\\(10 \\\\ge \\\\frac{100}{y} \\\\).",dependsOn:[1],hint:"The proof needs to establish that \\\\(y \\\\ge 10 \\\\)  before the inequality can be used."},{content:"Putting the inequalities \\\\(10 \\\\ge \\frac{100}{y} \\\\)  and \\\\(\\\\frac{100}{y} \\\\ge \\\\frac{x}{y} \\\\) , gives that \\\\(10 \\\\ge \\\\frac{x}{y} \\\\).",dependsOn:[2,3],hint:"The proof needs to establish both inequalities \\\\(10 \\\\ge \\\\frac{100}{y} \\\\)  and \\\\(\\\\frac{100}{y} \\\\ge \\\\frac{x}{y} \\\\)  before they can be used."}],explanation:"Correct. The steps of the proof are in a logical order.",orderedListName:"proof",prompt:"**Theorem:** For every pair of positive real numbers, \\\\(x \\\\) and \\\\(y\\\\) , if \\\\(\\frac{x}{y} \\\\gt 10\\\\) , then \\\\(x  \\\\gt 100 \\\\) or \\\\(y \\\\lt 10\\\\)."}},{name:"Duplicate content",options:{blocks:[{content:"t",dependsOn:[],hint:"t\\_1's hint"},{content:"a",dependsOn:[0],hint:"a's hint"},{content:"t",dependsOn:[1],hint:"t\\_2's hint"}],explanation:"explanation",orderedListName:"proof",prompt:"t\\_1 -> a -> t\\_2"}},{name:"Needs fullscreen",options:{blocks:Array(5).fill({content:"\\\\[ a \\\\\\\\ b \\\\\\\\ c \\\\\\\\ d \\\\]",dependsOn:[]}),explanation:"",orderedListName:"proof",prompt:"This needs fullscreen"}}]
